        "Content": "Hume Auctioneers ? We Get The Pick Of The Crop\n\nPresented in better than showhouse condition and enjoying one of the best locations in Portlaoise, this beautifully extended 3-bedroom residence boasts a magnificent address in Upper Beladd and overlooks a pristine greenspace. \n\nBeing within walking distance of 4 excellent primary schools, Portlaoise Hospital, shops and town centre, and enjoying a nearby bus stop, the property offers unrivalled convenience. The new Portlaoise GAA Super clubhouse (currently under construction) is just a short stroll away offering exciting new recreation for all the family.\n\nThe accommodation is entered through an attractive entrance porch, which immediately sets the tone for the beautifully maintained interior beyond. Superbly extended and presented in absolute mint condition and spotlessly clean throughout, the ground floor offers an exceptional choice of bright, generously proportioned living spaces.\n\nA comfortable sitting room provides an elegant setting for entertaining, while the separate cosy TV room is perfect for relaxed family evenings. The large dining room offers ample space for family gatherings and special occasions. A well-appointed kitchen complements the living accommodation, while the ground-floor bedroom provides valuable flexibility for guests, family members or those seeking single-level living.\n\nThere is a beautifully appointed utility room and a guest wc. \n\nFinished and cared for to an impeccable standard, this is a home that is genuinely ready for its new owners to move straight into and enjoy.\n\nThe first-floor accommodation is presented in pristine condition and comprises two spacious double bedrooms, both benefiting from excellent and extensive built-in wardrobes. The impressive master bedroom also enjoys its own private ensuite, while a beautifully appointed, fully tiled family bathroom completes the accommodation on this level.\n\nOutdoor Space\nTo the rear is a private, enclosed south facing garden, mainly laid in lawn with patio area, ideal for outdoor dining and family use. The detached garage is accessed from the garden and offers excellent storage or workshop potential. To the front, there is off-street parking via a private driveway.\n\nKey Features\n?3-bedroom semi-detached home\n Beautifully extended offering a new TV Room, Utility Room, Guest WC\n?Detached garage to the rear\n?Private driveway with off-street parking\n?Living room with solid fuel stove\n?Separate dining room with garden access\n?Ground-floor bedroom / home office\n?3 Bathrooms\n?Enclosed rear garden\n?Quiet, established residential location\n\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a magnificent family home in a prestigious location with great space both inside and out.\n"
      },
